        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86621, Transitional Riviera Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Riviera Door Pull is a transitional styled handle that will be sure to be noticed. Its unique style is truly beautiful. The Transitional Riviera Door Pull is available with thru-bolt mounting or concealed surface mounting. Choose from your favorite popular finish color option. This Riviera Pull is part of the Emtek Hollywood Regency Collection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/riviera-back-to-back-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86621\"><b>Riviera Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Riviera Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86621:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86622:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door. Packaged with  Decorative Screw Cover Caps.</li>\r\n<li><b>Concealed Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
