                "description": "The Riviera Door Pull is a transitional styled handle that will be sure to be noticed. Its unique style is truly beautiful. The Transitional Riviera Door Pull is available with thru-bolt mounting or concealed surface mounting. Choose from your favorite popular finish color option. This Riviera Pull is part of the Emtek Hollywood Regency Collection.",
